5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control. Let us look at winter road closures and former outreach attendance.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to check the bus links in the outer wards and the evening room bookings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the two programmes from six years ago and the volunteer register!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the funding structure is the real trap. I’ll examine the county grant terms and last year’s running costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to verify if our staff actually possess the skills for these new roles. I will check the volunteer register and tool certification.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is good to see everyone so focused. I hope the data will guide us wisely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,The bus data will tell us who is already cut off. I’ll wait for the others to share their findings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I can’t wait to see what those old records say! Did anyone else pick the volunteer list?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Minako, you picked the volunteer register too. Curious if we’ll find the same gaps, or if I’m just being paranoid about the paperwork.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin, I am checking for specific technical supervision gaps, not just general availability. We need to know if the roster can actually handle the new demands.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all looking at different angles. It helps to see the whole picture before we decide.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shizue: I am glad we are all looking at different angles. It helps to see the whole picture before we decide.""}]}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am curious how the evening bookings compare to remote catalogue peaks. It might reveal a mismatch in our current hours.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, do you think the money runs out before the work does?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, precisely. The grant covers year one, then the flat budget absorbs the shock. It’s a classic structural leak, not a size issue.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, the records will show if we have the certified technicians. If not, we cannot simply assume the work will happen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all looking at different angles. It helps to see the whole picture before we decide.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am curious how the evening bookings compare to remote catalogue peaks. It might reveal a mismatch in our current hours.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I just want to know if those old programs actually worked! Did anyone check if the records are still there?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the records are intact, but the funding trail is where the story gets interesting. Let’s see what the ledger says.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am confident the data will confirm my suspicions. We cannot assign tasks to people who lack the necessary training.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
