66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, exactly. The mobile unit needs drivers, not certified tool supervisors. It sidesteps the safety gap you identified.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, but the evening groups still meet! They didn’t need a budget to keep going. Why do we think new ideas need more money than they actually do?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, those groups are volunteer-run, not budgeted. I’m looking at the county grant terms. Year one is paid, year two is a flat budget shock.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the mobile service uses existing staff for driving and lending. It does not require the missing tool certification or external supervision I flagged.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, I understand the budget worry. But the halls stayed open when roads closed. A mobile unit is resilient, unlike a fixed building.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the isolation is the core issue. A mobile unit reaches those cut off by the bus rerouting, solving the access problem directly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, the old digitisation project failed because nobody finished it! We keep judging new ideas by how they sound, ignoring that similar shapes already left messy records here.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the archive failed because it lacked a finish line. The mobile service has a fixed weekly schedule. That structure prevents the drift that sank the old project.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the fixed schedule is manageable. We have drivers on the roster. The workshop lacks certified supervisors. I support the mobile service.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we found a path that respects both the need and the budget. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
