78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The structure holds, even if the ledger worries me. The fixed schedule prevents the drift that sank the archive. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,The roster supports this. We have the drivers and the lending skills required. No new supervision gaps. I vote for the Mobile Branch Service.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
